# Bouguer gravity anomaly color ramp — mGal.
# gdaldem color-relief format: <value> <r> <g> <b> [<a>]
# Diverging cmap centered on zero; transparent for nodata.
# Stops tuned for typical CONUS Bouguer range (~-250 to +50 mGal,
# heavily negative because crustal thickening dominates).
#
# Adjust stops if the source GeoTIFF uses different units (e.g. µGal,
# Gal, or values already in milligals-times-100).

nv 0 0 0 0
-300 8 8 80 220
-200 30 60 180 220
-150 30 120 200 220
-100 60 170 220 220
 -50 140 210 230 220
 -25 200 230 240 220
   0 255 255 255 220
  25 255 230 200 220
  50 250 200 140 220
 100 240 140 60 220
 150 220 60 30 220
 200 150 0 0 220
